WEBVTT

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:12.950
Not coming.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.770
Not coming. Not coming!

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.190
Uh... um, Eina?

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.420
Why?

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.290
Why isn't he coming?!

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:29.490
I mean, I know I'm also in the 
wrong for raising a hand to him!

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.160
But... But still!

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:33.840
Not giving me a detailed
explanation or showing his face!

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.170
Why's he being like that?!

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.250
E-Eina-san...

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.050
This isn't right.

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:41.960
This isn't right! This isn't right, is it?

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.490
What am I to Bell-kun, exactly?!

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.040
I...

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:51.020
I've never cried in front of a man before.

00:00:51.850 --> 00:00:53.190
Okay, I've had it!

00:00:53.530 --> 00:00:55.850
Team Leader, I'm going out on my rounds!

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:57.290
W-Wait, Tulle!

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.740
If you go, what will happen to 
that mountain of paperwork?

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.460
He's right, Eina! Calm down!

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.500
If the absence of a single person 
causes the workflow to break down,

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.330
then it's the organization that's at fault!

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.490
I'll just go to him, then!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:16.660
What's this?

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:20.380
Eina-chan! Where are you 
off to in such a hurry?

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:21.270
What?!

00:01:22.530 --> 00:01:24.720
Oh! Lord Hermes!

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:27.700
I see.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.960
You're going to see Bell-kun.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:33.170
But if you're looking for Bell-kun,
 he isn't at his Home.

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:33.640
What?

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.610
I'll tell you where he is.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.360
In return, can I ask you 
to do something for me?

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:53.050
Look. It's the Little Rookie.

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.460
Can't let him beat us to the 
punch this time, right?

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:57.510
Let's keep an eye on him.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.990
<i>It's all right.</i>

00:01:59.990 --> 00:02:02.480
<i>This is good. Don't be afraid.</i>

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:06.360
<i>We're going to get everyone to Knossos.</i>

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:08.400
<i>We won't fail.</i>

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.970
Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon? III

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:49.500
Invisible
 Forced Breakthrough

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:56.710
We have every door to Knossos 
under our control, right?

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:57.770
Yes.

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.460
Riveria-san, Gareth-san,
and the others are there.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:01.440
All right.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:05.670
Now, then, which door will 
the monsters head for?

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:08.940
They say Bell Cranel has appeared 
in the southeast districts!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:10.220
Has he?

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:13.360
If, as we expect, Bell Cranel is a diversion,

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.540
then the monsters will appear 
in a different district.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:21.260
But we can't say there is zero chance 
they'll deliberately do the opposite.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.050
Finn...

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:24.330
I'll watch him.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.580
Hmm...

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:26.860
I don't know about that.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.170
Ais, you've supported him too much.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:34.280
I won't let him go. 
If he tries anything strange...

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:36.150
I will stop him.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.880
And if monsters appear, I will defeat them.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.710
All right.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.330
I'll leave Bell Cranel to you.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.060
<i>Bell-kun!</i>

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.220
Yes, Goddess?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:59.950
The residents in the area of Daedalus Street
 have been guided to the Guild.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:03.080
We've heard they've all been evacuated 
to the main street to the east.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.380
We'll proceed with the operation as planned.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:06.170
<i>Understood.</i>

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.780
Welf-sama, Mikoto-sama? Let's see...

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.550
Please turn at the third corner.

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:13.360
<i>Got it!</i>

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:16.410
<i>Thank you, Haruhime-dono.</i>

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:20.880
Fels-sama's magic items truly 
are wonderful, aren't they?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.590
Not only do we know everyone's locations,

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:25.430
we can communicate with them!

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:26.580
Yeah!

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:31.080
And, right here, given to us by Ouranos,
 we have Daedalus' notes.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.860
With these, we should be 
able to guide everyone!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.520
<i>My role is to act as a diversion.</i>

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:47.270
<i>I have to attract as much of Loki Familia 
and the other adventures' attention as I can.</i>

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.030
<i>Ais-san...</i>

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:05.630
<i>Ais-san and no one else?</i>

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:08.210
<i>This is bad! It isn't what we planned!</i>

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:10.590
I have to tell my goddess.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:12.040
Boo.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:14.300
Hiya.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.800
Naza-san! Why are you here?

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:21.120
To help you and the others... I suppose.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:21.770
What?

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.230
<i>A woman?</i>

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:26.780
I don't know the circumstances, but...

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:30.160
You were probably chasing 
some girl's tail all over

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.590
and got caught up in some 
trouble again, right?

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:33.880
It's not like that!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:37.620
Besides, this is a directive 
from Miach-sama.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.410
"Don't ask anything, and go 
help Bell for me," he said.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.550
What?

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:43.870
So say whatever you like, Bell.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.330
Don't treat me like we're not friends.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:50.810
Thank you so much!

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:55.280
You're such a crybaby, aren't you, Bell?

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:58.610
<i>He's getting pat on the head?</i>

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.730
Then, I'll just borrow this, all right?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.380
Yes, thank you.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:12.940
<i>I have to do something to 
give Ais-san the slip somehow.</i>

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.200
Huh?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.730
Bell Cranel!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.340
Aisha-san! And...

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:20.810
Ryu-sa—

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:24.220
We heard about the situation from Andromeda.

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:26.310
We have come to help all 
of you knowing that.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:29.750
If there's anything you want 
us to do, we'll hear you out.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:32.210
Really? In that case...

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.770
<i>More women. This time two of them?</i>

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:43.220
Oh, you! You really say the 
most outrageous things.

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:46.930
We will do it, if that is what you wish.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:49.000
Thank you so—

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.690
I don't mind.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:55.420
But when this is over, I expect to be repaid.

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.650
Unhand Cranel-san!

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:02.290
If you do not, I shall beat you down first.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:03.920
Go ahead and try.

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:06.610
I've had my prey stolen out 
from under me so many times,

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:08.000
I'm all kinds of pent up.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:13.170
<i>He's being... hugged?</i>

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.580
They're finally gone.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:22.440
<i>She's </i>really<i> staring at me!</i>

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.240
Bell-kun!

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:23.700
What?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.920
E-Eina-san?

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.360
Wh-Why are you here?

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.910
Because no matter how long I waited,
 you never showed up!

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:33.590
So I came to you!

00:08:33.590 --> 00:08:35.000
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.020
I just, um...

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:38.480
I felt so uncomfortable about everything. 
I didn't know how to face you!

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:42.380
Still, you could have gotten in 
touch with me, couldn't you?

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:45.460
I guess I'm just some woman you 
see when it's convenient, aren't I?!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:46.350
Convenient?!

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:49.210
Putting it like that invites all 
kinds of misunderstandings!

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:53.090
At any rate, until you tell 
me everything I want to know,

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.680
I'm not letting you go home today!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.390
Wait! E-Eina-san!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.870
<i>Yet another woman?</i>

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.130
No!

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.420
I can't!

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:03.090
<i>It's only been women.</i>

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.490
I'm not letting you go today!

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:05.140
I really can't!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:06.560
<i>Is Bell... a delinquent?</i>

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.640
Bell-kun!

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:10.530
<i>Eina-san! Please, let me go!</i>

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:14.240
For a while now, the sound of 
Bell-sama's screams has been...

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.690
It seems something unforeseen 
is happening, but...

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:21.920
We can't do anything about it from here.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.610
Welf-kun, Mikoto-kun...

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:30.330
That underground waterway ahead of you...
The Xenos should be hiding there.

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:33.280
Understood, Hestia-sama.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:38.010
I am able to gaze upon the 
sky I so wished to see,

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:41.010
but to think it would be while having 
to sneak around like this.

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.570
I guess being outcasts in the 
shadows suits us best after all.

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.350
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.480
Welf-san, Mikoto-san...

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.820
Everyone! I'm glad to see you're all safe!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.660
Is Bell going to be all right?

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:02.790
For now, just have faith in the boy, Wiene.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.430
We're going to repay his kindness, right?

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:07.530
Yes.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.630
Lyd, if you would.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.540
Right.

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:41.760
<i>Lyd-san!</i>

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:56.120
Fear and Lett, as well as... Arles and Helga.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:59.040
I can't hear Asterius's voice.

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:01.660
He wouldn't fail to reach us.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:04.430
He's either hiding, or...

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.350
All we can do is go.

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.470
We will have faith in them.

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:32.200
Ottarl, a moment?

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.120
Yes.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:38.580
If you would make a move, please? Though, 
what I am about to say may go to waste.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:41.780
I cannot see what lies ahead, either.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:43.720
Even if that may be so,

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.870
I shall make your divine 
intention a reality.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.010
Where are they?

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:51.630
Where are those monsters calling from?

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:52.490
Find them!

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:53.610
Don't let your guard down!

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:56.040
Let's go!

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:00.510
I hate this! It's scary!

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:02.420
Why is Lili doing this?

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:08.500
Your scars are mine.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.580
My scars are mine.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:13.950
Whoa! One just appeared!

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.670
It's an al-miraj!

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:17.860
Take this!

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.890
Stroke of midnight's bell!

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:37.530
Hey! Where did the al-miraj go?

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:39.940
Th-That way.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:44.410
Fels-sama... I hate you for this!

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:47.180
Oh! There!

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:48.330
Corner it!

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.530
Don't let it get away!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:50.790
This way!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.240
<i>Lili's made her move!</i>

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:55.740
<i>I have to, too!</i>

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.510
Eina-san!

00:12:58.070 --> 00:12:58.920
What?

00:12:59.690 --> 00:13:00.860
I'm sorry!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.960
You can get as mad as you want at me later!

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.400
Bell-kun!

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.540
I'd like for you to give this to Bell-kun.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:15.530
I missed my chance to give it to him.

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:17.320
Huh?

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.240
It... It won't come off?

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.810
The Little Rookie's on the move!

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:24.660
After him!

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:26.850
<i>Where is Ais-san?</i>

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.670
<i>She's still following me.</i>

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.910
<i>At this rate, I'll fail as a diversion!</i>

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:35.370
<i>I'll just have to give her...
 and everyone else the slip all at once!</i>

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:43.210
He's not here!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.840
Where did he go?

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.360
There! The Little Rookie!

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:48.760
He went in that house!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:50.690
No! He ran that way!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.150
A swarm of monsters!

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:58.840
<i>Huh. This really does make 
people see illusions.</i>

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:00.330
<i>That Bell.</i>

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.060
<i>Where did he manage to acquire 
something like this?</i>

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:08.310
Bell... disappeared?

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:15.370
<i>Thank you, Naza-san!</i>

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:18.870
No. I feel his presence.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:20.830
That way.

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:24.470
Sword Princess.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.950
I'd like to spar with you.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.680
Now? Here?

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.800
I am another dweller in the shadows.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:37.190
If not for a situation like this, I would 
not be able to cross swords with you.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.370
You will accept my request.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:48.860
Will that elf be all right?

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:54.170
Wallenwhatsit-kun is unbelievably strong,
 but Elf-kun is strong, too.

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:57.820
By borrowing the strength of your level boost,
 she should manage somehow.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.570
<i>Goddess!</i>

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:03.310
Thanks to Ryu-san, I've managed to 
get some distance from Ais-san.

00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:05.080
Good work, Bell-kun!

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:09.250
Keep dragging adventurers and the Loki Familia 
around like that, and cause some distractions!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:10.690
<i>Will do!</i>

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:15.210
Or so I say, but...

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:17.900
That's the Loki Familia for you.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.670
Their formations just aren't falling apart.

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:23.640
An al-miraj has appeared to the south!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:27.050
The southeast squad is also 
reporting monster sightings!

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.030
Bell Cranel is also in the southeast!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:32.850
Ais-san seems to be being 
held in place by someone.

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:35.340
Pay no attention to Bell Cranel.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:37.090
Ais will return soon.

00:15:37.090 --> 00:15:38.590
Maintain current positions.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.630
Is there any information 
regarding the black minotaur?

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:43.500
Nothing yet.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.650
I see.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:45.790
We'll monitor the situation.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:49.500
<i>The monsters should be in a large group.</i>

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:53.260
<i>The fact that we can't find them 
is attributable to magic items,</i>

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:58.220
<i>or the presence of someone very familiar 
with the area, or perhaps both.</i>

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.220
There seems to be a lot going 
on to the south, but...

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:08.240
We have to keep watch here, right?

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:09.690
Raul!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:12.390
Huh? Commander? Why are you here?

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:14.160
What about command?

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:17.370
A large force of monsters has appeared 
in the vicinity of the encampment!

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.430
You will head there at once!

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:21.550
H-Huh? To the center of town?

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:22.320
And Raul,

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.550
how is the guarding the 
doors to Knossos going?

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.260
Um, well...

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:30.170
The ones we found in the 
northwest and northeast,

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:32.420
plus the ones in the southwest and southeast,
 four doors all together,

00:16:32.420 --> 00:16:35.320
have Riveria-san, Gareth-san, 
and the others watching them!

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:37.030
Right!

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.890
You will all immediately gather your 
equipment and head to the center of town!

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:41.800
I will head to the southeast!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.510
Y-Yes, sir!

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:49.090
Stroke of midnight's bell.

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.770
He's just as gullible as Bell-sama!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.490
Hestia-sama!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.650
The defense of Knossos is as we expected.

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:02.270
<i>The northwest, northeast, southwest, 
and southeast. Four positions.</i>

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:04.330
That's great work, Miss Supporter!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.000
You're amazing, Lili-sama!

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:09.200
Four of the doors are under 
the enemy's control.

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:12.810
Of the others, the closest 
to the Xenos is...

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:15.350
The west!

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:18.670
Fels-kun! The west door is open!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.130
<i>Understood, Goddess Hestia.</i>

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.900
Once we leave here, the Loki Familia's 
forces will be right in front of us.

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:28.600
Thanks to the diversions, 
the surface is in chaos.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:32.060
We will slip through the cracks 
and aim for the western door.

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.530
All right. Is everyone ready?

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:38.840
Let's go!

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:48.740
We have reports that a large group of 
monsters has suddenly appeared in the west!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:50.070
What?

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.680
What happened to Raul and 
the others' defense?

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:52.990
Huh? Commander?

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.710
Raul? What are you doing?

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:57.940
Huh? Just now, the commander told us 
to head to the center of town.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:00.550
The commander never gave that order.

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:02.900
But I'm sure the commander came...

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.710
<i>They got us.</i>

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.850
<i>Either a magic item or magic.</i>

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:10.140
What route is the enemy taking? 
Where are they going?

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:15.980
They are headed east, and they seem to 
be progressing in a straight line.

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:17.620
To the east?

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.990
We have discovered four 
doors leading underground.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:27.200
If they appeared to the west, they should 
be heading northeast or southeast, but...

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:30.460
<i>Is there a door we don't know about?</i>

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:35.780
Thanks to Bell-cchi and Lili-cchi, 
there are hardly any adventurers around!

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:38.760
Do not let down your guard!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:39.790
Here they come!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.930
Ready arrows!

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:02.770
With these, we should be able to progress 
without destroying the city, Welf-dono!

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:03.540
Yeah!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:07.030
A little further, and you will 
emerge onto a broad street.

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:08.970
Keep going straight!

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.540
<i>Understood, Haruhime-dono.</i>

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:14.140
Mikoto-kun! Welf-kun! Hang in there for us!

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:17.500
Now!

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.340
Not letting you do that!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:23.210
Hien!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.900
Thank you, Welf-cchi!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:30.290
All right. We'll run all the way through!

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.410
Huh?

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:49.190
I went too far.

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:52.120
Riveria is going to give 
me another scolding.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:54.590
Huh?

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:58.510
A magic sword, is it?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.530
I'll take care of this guy, somehow.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:01.930
You guys go on ahead!

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.030
Thank you.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:04.630
Everyone, on your feet! We run!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.970
There are two of you... correct?

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:24.640
I must pursue the monsters.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:27.190
You will move aside!

00:20:29.220 --> 00:20:31.660
Welf-dono, I will use it!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:32.780
Fuubu!

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:39.420
All right! Everyone's on the move!

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:43.040
Hang in there, Welf-kun, Mikoto-kun!

00:20:43.540 --> 00:20:44.630
Hestia-sama!

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:46.200
Is this...?

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.800
What? Wiene-kun?

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.970
Where is everyone?

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:06.220
No, Wiene-kun! Don't go that way!

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.760
Wh-What do we do?

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:11.560
I will go!

00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:12.160
What?

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:17.720
Wait! Haruhime-kun!

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:23.490
This is bad. This is really bad!

00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:26.060
<i>Bell-kun!</i>

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:30.730
<i>Wiene-kun's gotten separated! 
And Haruhime-kun's run off!</i>

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:32.370
<i>If we don't do something...</i>

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:34.060
Wiene's alone?

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:46.190
Everyone...

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:47.760
Huh?

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:51.860
I never thought I'd find one here.

00:21:55.540 --> 00:21:58.930
Well, now that I've found you, 
what else can I do?

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.660
I'll be taking you down!

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>Ultra Soul
Decisive Battle</b>

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:38.450
Next time,

00:23:38.450 --> 00:23:39.840
"Ultra Soul."
